{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667720/extras/SteamPageGifSlow.gif?t=1752969338\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Create the Perfect Team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each ally has their own ability, event outcomes and synergies... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, draft carefully: because without knowing how to scale your team to victory, you'll end up as a snack for the bigger threats which lurk further within the woods...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667720/extras/BuffGif.gif?t=1752969338\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Snappy Runs, Deep Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beneath the quick pace is a layered roguelite system that rewards planning and adaptability.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Runs take only 10 minutes once mastered</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build powerful scaling combos as your run unfolds</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New mechanics unlock over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Easy to learn, endlessly replayable</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667720/extras/HaT_HeroSleeping200.gif?t=1752969338\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Map Navigation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tread carefully, for the forest is fickle... and the fog will always follow. Every tile is a choice.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prioritize the right tiles for your team's needs\u00a0while knowing when to improvise</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch out for the creeping fog which closes in from the edge of the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clever decision-making can make (or break!) your run</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667720/extras/TileShuffleGif.gif?t=1752969338\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Easy to Learn, Hard to Master</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deceptively simple rules combine into a game that's both familiar and unique, full of secrets and challenges... do you believe you have what it takes to overcome the enchanted forest?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667720?t=1752969338","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667720/106fdac96484d6c40616cbe4083906fa88070fa9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752969338","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667720/6f3ce66528b7b5b83548f7a3f40822e8f1088526/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752969338","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667720/6f3ce66528b7b5b83548f7a3f40822e8f1088526/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752969338","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3745660,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667720/extras/SteamPageGifSlow.gif?t=1752969338\" /></div></p><h2 cla